    "body": "ESP32-WROOM-32 bench firmware and Flutter Android controller, built from tag v1.0.0-test.\n\nThis is a prerelease for bench development, NOT flight-certified firmware. Real motor output remains locked. Local AP credentials must be provisioned and firmware rebuilt for hardware use. The APK is universal and debug-signed. No physical ESP32, ESC, sensor or Android device validation is claimed. See docs/validation.md and docs/safety.md.\n\nAssets: source ZIP from the exact tag, application BIN (use PlatformIO for correct bootloader/partition offsets), Android APK, and SHA256SUMS.txt. CI builds the same tagged source; the CI debug signing key differs from the cloud workspace key.\n"
